{#- =========================================================
   TimeLens Temporal Grounding Prompt Template

   We pass the dataset's ``messages[0].content`` through verbatim — it already
   contains the full instruction and few-shot example, so this template only
   trims it. This keeps train-time and eval-time prompts identical.

   If the dataset stores a bare question instead of the full prompt, set
   ``TIMELENS_APPEND_FORMAT_HINT=1`` to append a fallback hint elsewhere.
   ========================================================= -#}
{%- if problem is defined -%}
{%- set question = problem -%}
{%- elif content is defined -%}
{%- set question = content -%}
{%- else -%}
{{ 1 / 0 }}
{%- endif -%}
{{ question | trim }}
